{"text":"ח׳"}
{"end":"t:abbr"}
{"start":"t:expan","attrs":{}}
{"text":"חזן"}
{"end":"t:expan"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":" לְבִלְתִּי לְנַבֵּל לְמַעֲנוֹ כִּסֵּא. עוֹד יִפְצֶה פֶּה וַיִּפְגַּע כִּסֵּא. זְכוֹר לְיוֹשְׁבֵי נְטָעִים אֲשֶׁר עִמְּךָ בַּכִּסֵּא: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:vechayyot_asher_hennah/rachem_metzuqim"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"description","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:instruction:role/reader_and_congregation","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:abbr","attrs":{}}
{"text":"קו״ח"}
{"end":"t:abbr"}
{"start":"t:expan","attrs":{}}
{"text":"קהל וחזן"}
{"end":"t:expan"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":" רַחֵם מְצוּקִים אֲשֶׁר עֲלֵיהֶם שַׂמְתָּ הֲדוֹם וְכִסֵּא. וְאָז יִתְרַעַם הַגַּלְגַּל וְיִתְרַעַשׁ הַכִּסֵּא. וְאוֹפַן לְאוֹפַן "}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}id":"musaf_vechayyot_asher_hennah_source_variant_2"}}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:condition:poem:vechayyot_asher_hennah/rachem_metzuqim/chayyah_then_keruv"}}
{"text":"וְחַיָּה לְחַיָּה וּכְרוּב לִכְרוּב"}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:condition:poem:vechayyot_asher_hennah/rachem_metzuqim/keruv_then_chayyah"}}
{"text":"וּכְרוּב לִכְרוּב וְחַיָּה לְחַיָּה"}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"tail":" לְעֻמַּת כִּסֵּא: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
